Source: deb-progress-installer
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: cybermaxpower <carber.maxpower@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: deb-progress-installer
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Description: A graphical utility to install .deb packages with a progress bar.
 This utility provides a clean GUI interface for installing local Debian packages
 while showing a real-time progress bar.

